cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the original thesis (preferred-citation below)."
title: "Graphene Defect Detector"
abstract: >
  A pipeline that detects structural defects in simulated nanographene
  samples with YOLOv8 object detection, measures their geometry with
  OpenCV, and predicts each sample's total energy from that geometry with
  a gradient-boosted regressor. Implements the method developed in the
  author's engineering thesis at CNR-ISMN (Istituto per lo Studio dei
  Materiali Nanostrutturati), University of Bologna.
authors:
  - family-names: Ceccolini
    given-names: Gabriele
date-released: 2023-01-01
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Gabrocecco/GrapheDefectDetector"
